{"id":"1d39b089ae4eb942","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-infinitary-satisfaction-data.md","title":"Lκκ 的集合编码语法与满意递归","display":"df-infinitary-satisfaction-data — Lκκ 的集合编码语法与满意递归","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-infinitary-satisfaction-data","aliases":["58-df-infinitary-satisfaction-data"],"display":"df-infinitary-satisfaction-data — Lκκ 的集合编码语法与满意递归","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-infinitary-satisfaction-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-infinitary-satisfaction-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-infinitary-satisfaction-data — Lκκ 的集合编码语法与满意递归"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 是无限基数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为下式约束的词汇集合。非逻辑符号本身用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle i,\\langle a,n\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle i,\\langle a,n\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span> 编码：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=0,n=0\">\\(i=0,n=0\\)</span> 为常量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=1,n&gt;0\">\\(i=1,n&gt;0\\)</span> 为函数符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=2,n&gt;0\">\\(i=2,n&gt;0\\)</span> 为关系符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in V\">\\(a\\in V\\)</span> 仅为符号标识。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_\\tau,F_\\tau,R_\\tau\">\\(C_\\tau,F_\\tau,R_\\tau\\)</span> 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 中上述三类符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau=\\{\\langle\\langle i,\\langle a,n\\rangle\\rangle,n\\rangle:\\langle i,\\langle a,n\\rangle\\rangle\\in F_\\tau\\cup R_\\tau\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau=\\{\\langle\\langle i,\\langle a,n\\rangle\\rangle,n\\rangle:\\langle i,\\langle a,n\\rangle\\rangle\\in F_\\tau\\cup R_\\tau\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\tau=\\langle R_\\tau,F_\\tau,C_\\tau,\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau\\rangle\">\\(L_\\tau=\\langle R_\\tau,F_\\tau,C_\\tau,\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau\\rangle\\)</span>。只在合法词汇上使用这些投影。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>项的构造子是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\alpha^*=\\langle0,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(v_\\alpha^*=\\langle0,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\)</span>）、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c^*=\\langle1,c\\rangle\">\\(c^*=\\langle1,c\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^*(\\vec t)=\\langle2,\\langle f,\\vec t\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(f^*(\\vec t)=\\langle2,\\langle f,\\vec t\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span>；函数项的参数序列是有限集合函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\kappa^n\">\\(\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\kappa^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s^\\frown i\">\\(s^\\frown i\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\">\\(s^\\frown\\langle i\\rangle\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ch}_D(s)=\\{i&lt;\\kappa:s^\\frown i\\in D\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ch}_D(s)=\\{i&lt;\\kappa:s^\\frown i\\in D\\}\\)</span>。公式编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle\">\\(\\varphi=\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(D\\subseteq\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；根为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>节点标签为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{eq}(t,u)=\\langle0,\\langle t,u\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{eq}(t,u)=\\langle0,\\langle t,u\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rel}(R,\\vec t)=\\langle1,\\langle R,\\vec t\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{rel}(R,\\vec t)=\\langle1,\\langle R,\\vec t\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{neg}=\\langle2,\\varnothing\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{neg}=\\langle2,\\varnothing\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{conj}(\\delta)=\\langle3,\\delta\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{conj}(\\delta)=\\langle3,\\delta\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{all}(\\vec\\xi)=\\langle4,\\vec\\xi\\rangle\">\\(\\mathrm{all}(\\vec\\xi)=\\langle4,\\vec\\xi\\rangle\\)</span>。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Labels}_{\\kappa,\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Labels}_{\\kappa,\\tau}\\)</span>、项集和公式集都是集合，不是类大小的未限定语法域。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(U=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\">\\(I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\)</span> 使用结构文件的解释投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Val}(t,s)=\\operatorname{Val}(\\langle t,s\\rangle)\">\\(\\operatorname{Val}(t,s)=\\operatorname{Val}(\\langle t,s\\rangle)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(d,s)=S(\\langle d,s\\rangle)\">\\(S(d,s)=S(\\langle d,s\\rangle)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in U^\\kappa\">\\(s\\in U^\\kappa\\)</span>、单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\xi:\\delta\\to\\kappa\">\\(\\vec\\xi:\\delta\\to\\kappa\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in U^\\delta\">\\(a\\in U^\\delta\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[\\vec\\xi\\mapsto a]=(s\\upharpoonright(\\kappa\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\xi)))\\cup\\{\\langle\\vec\\xi(i),a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;\\delta\\}\">\\(s[\\vec\\xi\\mapsto a]=(s\\upharpoonright(\\kappa\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\xi)))\\cup\\{\\langle\\vec\\xi(i),a(i)\\rangle:i&lt;\\delta\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfinitaryFormulaData}\">\\(\\mathrm{InfinitaryFormulaData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfinitarySatisfaction}\">\\(\\mathrm{InfinitarySatisfaction}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfinitaryTermEvaluation}\">\\(\\mathrm{InfinitaryTermEvaluation}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfinitaryVocabulary}\">\\(\\mathrm{InfinitaryVocabulary}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfinitaryVocabulary}_S(\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall q\\in\\tau\\;\\exists a\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(q=\\langle0,\\langle a,0\\rangle\\rangle\n\\lor\\exists i\\in\\{1,2\\}\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\nq=\\langle i,\\langle a,n\\rangle\\rangle\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{InfinitaryVocabulary}_S(\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall q\\in\\tau\\;\\exists a\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(q=\\langle0,\\langle a,0\\rangle\\rangle\n\\lor\\exists i\\in\\{1,2\\}\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\nq=\\langle i,\\langle a,n\\rangle\\rangle\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}_0\\coloneqq\n\\{v_\\alpha^*:\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\}\\cup\\{c^*:c\\in C_\\tau\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}_0\\coloneqq\n\\{v_\\alpha^*:\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\}\\cup\\{c^*:c\\in C_\\tau\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}_{n+1}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}_n\\cup\n\\{f^*(\\vec t):f\\in F_\\tau\\land\\vec t\\in(\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}_n)^{\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(f)}\\},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}_{n+1}\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}_n\\cup\n\\{f^*(\\vec t):f\\in F_\\tau\\land\\vec t\\in(\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}_n)^{\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(f)}\\},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{TV}_{\\kappa,\\tau}(v_\\alpha^*)\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{TV}_{\\kappa,\\tau}(c^*)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{TV}_{\\kappa,\\tau}(f^*(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(f)}\\mathrm{TV}_{\\kappa,\\tau}(\\vec t(i)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{TV}_{\\kappa,\\tau}(v_\\alpha^*)\\coloneqq\\{\\alpha\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{TV}_{\\kappa,\\tau}(c^*)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{TV}_{\\kappa,\\tau}(f^*(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(f)}\\mathrm{TV}_{\\kappa,\\tau}(\\vec t(i)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Labels}_{\\kappa,\\tau}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\mathrm{eq}(t,u):t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{rel}(R,\\vec t):R\\in R_\\tau\\land\\vec t\\in(\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau})^{\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(R)}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\mathrm{neg}\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{conj}(\\delta):\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{all}(\\vec\\xi):\\exists\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Injective}(\\vec\\xi,\\delta,\\kappa)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Labels}_{\\kappa,\\tau}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\mathrm{eq}(t,u):t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{rel}(R,\\vec t):R\\in R_\\tau\\land\\vec t\\in(\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau})^{\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(R)}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\mathrm{neg}\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{conj}(\\delta):\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\}\n\\cup\\{\\mathrm{all}(\\vec\\xi):\\exists\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Injective}(\\vec\\xi,\\delta,\\kappa)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TreeCodes}_{\\kappa,\\tau}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle:D\\subseteq\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\ell\\in(\\mathrm{Labels}_{\\kappa,\\tau})^D\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TreeCodes}_{\\kappa,\\tau}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle:D\\subseteq\\kappa^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\ell\\in(\\mathrm{Labels}_{\\kappa,\\tau})^D\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{InfinitaryFormulaData}_S(\\varphi,F,\\kappa,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{InfinitaryVocabulary}_S(\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists D,\\ell\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\varphi=\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{TreeCodes}_{\\kappa,\\tau}\n\\land\\varnothing\\in D\\land F\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa)^D\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in D\\;\\forall n\\leq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;(s\\upharpoonright n\\in D)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq D\\;(A\\ne\\varnothing\\to\n\\exists s\\in A\\;\\forall i&lt;\\kappa\\;(s^\\frown i\\notin A))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in D\\;\\Bigl(|F(s)|&lt;\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}\\;\n(\\ell(s)=\\mathrm{eq}(t,u)\\to\n\\mathrm{Ch}_D(s)=\\varnothing\\land F(s)=\\mathrm{TV}_{\\kappa,\\tau}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{TV}_{\\kappa,\\tau}(u))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall R\\in R_\\tau\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in(\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau})^{\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(R)}\\;\n(\\ell(s)=\\mathrm{rel}(R,\\vec t)\\to\n\\mathrm{Ch}_D(s)=\\varnothing\\land F(s)=\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(R)}\\mathrm{TV}_{\\kappa,\\tau}(\\vec t(i)))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\ell(s)=\\mathrm{neg}\\to\n\\mathrm{Ch}_D(s)=\\{0\\}\\land F(s)=F(s^\\frown0))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\;\n(\\ell(s)=\\mathrm{conj}(\\delta)\\to\n\\mathrm{Ch}_D(s)=\\delta\\land F(s)=\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\delta}F(s^\\frown i))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\;\\forall\\vec\\xi\\in\\kappa^\\delta\\;\n(\\mathrm{Injective}(\\vec\\xi,\\delta,\\kappa)\\land\\ell(s)=\\mathrm{all}(\\vec\\xi)\\to\n\\mathrm{Ch}_D(s)=\\{0\\}\\land F(s)=F(s^\\frown0)\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\xi))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{InfinitaryFormulaData}_S(\\varphi,F,\\kappa,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{InfinitaryVocabulary}_S(\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists D,\\ell\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\varphi=\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{TreeCodes}_{\\kappa,\\tau}\n\\land\\varnothing\\in D\\land F\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa)^D\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in D\\;\\forall n\\leq\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\;(s\\upharpoonright n\\in D)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq D\\;(A\\ne\\varnothing\\to\n\\exists s\\in A\\;\\forall i&lt;\\kappa\\;(s^\\frown i\\notin A))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in D\\;\\Bigl(|F(s)|&lt;\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}\\;\n(\\ell(s)=\\mathrm{eq}(t,u)\\to\n\\mathrm{Ch}_D(s)=\\varnothing\\land F(s)=\\mathrm{TV}_{\\kappa,\\tau}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{TV}_{\\kappa,\\tau}(u))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall R\\in R_\\tau\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in(\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau})^{\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(R)}\\;\n(\\ell(s)=\\mathrm{rel}(R,\\vec t)\\to\n\\mathrm{Ch}_D(s)=\\varnothing\\land F(s)=\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(R)}\\mathrm{TV}_{\\kappa,\\tau}(\\vec t(i)))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\ell(s)=\\mathrm{neg}\\to\n\\mathrm{Ch}_D(s)=\\{0\\}\\land F(s)=F(s^\\frown0))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\;\n(\\ell(s)=\\mathrm{conj}(\\delta)\\to\n\\mathrm{Ch}_D(s)=\\delta\\land F(s)=\\bigcup_{i&lt;\\delta}F(s^\\frown i))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\;\\forall\\vec\\xi\\in\\kappa^\\delta\\;\n(\\mathrm{Injective}(\\vec\\xi,\\delta,\\kappa)\\land\\ell(s)=\\mathrm{all}(\\vec\\xi)\\to\n\\mathrm{Ch}_D(s)=\\{0\\}\\land F(s)=F(s^\\frown0)\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec\\xi))\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}^{\\kappa,\\tau}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{TreeCodes}_{\\kappa,\\tau}:\\exists F\\;\\mathrm{InfinitaryFormulaData}_S(\\varphi,F,\\kappa,\\tau)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Fml}^{\\kappa,\\tau}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{TreeCodes}_{\\kappa,\\tau}:\\exists F\\;\\mathrm{InfinitaryFormulaData}_S(\\varphi,F,\\kappa,\\tau)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InfinitarySentence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\varphi,\\kappa,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,\\ell,F\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\varphi=\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{InfinitaryFormulaData}_S(\\varphi,F,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\land F(\\varnothing)=\\varnothing\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{InfinitarySentence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\varphi,\\kappa,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,\\ell,F\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\varphi=\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{InfinitaryFormulaData}_S(\\varphi,F,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\land F(\\varnothing)=\\varnothing\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{InfinitaryTermEvaluation}_S(\\operatorname{Val},\\mathcal M,\\kappa,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{InfinitaryVocabulary}_S(\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L_\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{Val},\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}\\times U^\\kappa,U)\n\\land\\forall s\\in U^\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(\\operatorname{Val}(v_\\alpha^*,s)=s(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall c\\in C_\\tau\\;(\\operatorname{Val}(c^*,s)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall f\\in F_\\tau\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in(\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau})^{\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(f)}\\;\n\\operatorname{Val}(f^*(\\vec t),s)=\nI^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(f)}(f)\n(\\{\\langle i,\\operatorname{Val}(\\vec t(i),s)\\rangle:i&lt;\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(f)\\})\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{InfinitaryTermEvaluation}_S(\\operatorname{Val},\\mathcal M,\\kappa,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{InfinitaryVocabulary}_S(\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L_\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{Val},\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}\\times U^\\kappa,U)\n\\land\\forall s\\in U^\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;(\\operatorname{Val}(v_\\alpha^*,s)=s(\\alpha))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall c\\in C_\\tau\\;(\\operatorname{Val}(c^*,s)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall f\\in F_\\tau\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in(\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau})^{\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(f)}\\;\n\\operatorname{Val}(f^*(\\vec t),s)=\nI^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(f)}(f)\n(\\{\\langle i,\\operatorname{Val}(\\vec t(i),s)\\rangle:i&lt;\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(f)\\})\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{InfinitarySatisfaction}_S(S,\\varphi,\\mathcal M,\\kappa,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,\\ell,F,\\operatorname{Val}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\varphi=\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{InfinitaryFormulaData}_S(\\varphi,F,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{InfinitaryTermEvaluation}_S(\\operatorname{Val},\\mathcal M,\\kappa,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S,D\\times U^\\kappa,\\{0,1\\})\n\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;\\forall s\\in U^\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}\\;\n(\\ell(d)=\\mathrm{eq}(t,u)\\to(S(d,s)=1\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Val}(t,s)=\\operatorname{Val}(u,s)))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall R\\in R_\\tau\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in(\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau})^{\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(R)}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\ell(d)=\\mathrm{rel}(R,\\vec t)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(S(d,s)=1\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\langle i,\\operatorname{Val}(\\vec t(i),s)\\rangle:i&lt;\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(R)\\}\n\\in I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(R)}(R))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\ell(d)=\\mathrm{neg}\\to(S(d,s)=1\\leftrightarrow S(d^\\frown0,s)=0))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\;\n(\\ell(d)=\\mathrm{conj}(\\delta)\\to(S(d,s)=1\\leftrightarrow\\forall i&lt;\\delta\\;S(d^\\frown i,s)=1))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\;\\forall\\vec\\xi\\in\\kappa^\\delta\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Injective}(\\vec\\xi,\\delta,\\kappa)\\land\\ell(d)=\\mathrm{all}(\\vec\\xi)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(S(d,s)=1\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in U^\\delta\\;S(d^\\frown0,s[\\vec\\xi\\mapsto a])=1)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{InfinitarySatisfaction}_S(S,\\varphi,\\mathcal M,\\kappa,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists D,\\ell,F,\\operatorname{Val}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\varphi=\\langle D,\\ell\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{InfinitaryFormulaData}_S(\\varphi,F,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\land\\mathrm{InfinitaryTermEvaluation}_S(\\operatorname{Val},\\mathcal M,\\kappa,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S,D\\times U^\\kappa,\\{0,1\\})\n\\land\\forall d\\in D\\;\\forall s\\in U^\\kappa\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\forall t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau}\\;\n(\\ell(d)=\\mathrm{eq}(t,u)\\to(S(d,s)=1\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Val}(t,s)=\\operatorname{Val}(u,s)))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall R\\in R_\\tau\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in(\\mathrm{Trm}^{\\kappa,\\tau})^{\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(R)}\\;\n\\Bigl(\\ell(d)=\\mathrm{rel}(R,\\vec t)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(S(d,s)=1\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\langle i,\\operatorname{Val}(\\vec t(i),s)\\rangle:i&lt;\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(R)\\}\n\\in I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},\\mathrm{ar}_\\tau(R)}(R))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\ell(d)=\\mathrm{neg}\\to(S(d,s)=1\\leftrightarrow S(d^\\frown0,s)=0))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\;\n(\\ell(d)=\\mathrm{conj}(\\delta)\\to(S(d,s)=1\\leftrightarrow\\forall i&lt;\\delta\\;S(d^\\frown i,s)=1))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\delta&lt;\\kappa\\;\\forall\\vec\\xi\\in\\kappa^\\delta\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Injective}(\\vec\\xi,\\delta,\\kappa)\\land\\ell(d)=\\mathrm{all}(\\vec\\xi)\\to\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad(S(d,s)=1\\leftrightarrow\\forall a\\in U^\\delta\\;S(d^\\frown0,s[\\vec\\xi\\mapsto a])=1)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LkkModel}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal M,T,\\kappa,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{InfinitaryVocabulary}_S(\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L_\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{InfinitarySentence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\varphi,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists S\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{InfinitarySatisfaction}_S(S,\\varphi,\\mathcal M,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\land\\forall s\\in U^\\kappa\\;S(\\varnothing,s)=1\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LkkModel}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathcal M,T,\\kappa,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\leq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{InfinitaryVocabulary}_S(\\tau)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L_\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{InfinitarySentence}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\varphi,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\land\\exists S\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{InfinitarySatisfaction}_S(S,\\varphi,\\mathcal M,\\kappa,\\tau)\n\\land\\forall s\\in U^\\kappa\\;S(\\varnothing,s)=1\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有公式树和赋值都在显式集合域内；良基条件排除无限下降语法分支，自由变量条件限制每个子公式的自由变量数小于 κ。此文件补足原 compact-cardinal 所需的 Lκκ 语法与语义，不改变普通一阶公式编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-lang